Z||000000||Richard Parnell||04-05-2000||01:00 PM||||Is there a way to use a manual trans on the Northstar in a Fiero?  I seem to remember something about that at another site which I can't find now. I've been thinking about getting another cradle and putting a Northstar into that and tinker with it while enjoying driving my SC after I have my 350 in.  When I get the alternate engine together I can swap cradles back and forth after new engine mods.  I know I'm getting way ahead of myself here, but it's nice to dream.||||reg||5
