Z||000003||Richard Parnell||04-06-2000||02:22 PM||||Right now I have a 4 banger in the car.  I have the 350 sitting on a dolly in my carport.  I'm in the process of getting together the parts list of what is actually needed for the swap and best source/prices for those parts.  I'm also revamping the suspension which seems to be adding up to almost as much as the engine swap. I keep stalling on the actual start date for the swap because I'm fascinated by that 4 cyl. in the car now.  I've been running the C%8#p out of it and it still runs great, it's sort of like I want to see how long it will run.  Doesn't burn oil, slight oil leak around valve cover and is amazingly fast for a 4 cyl.  No I don't have a Nstar, just daydreaming there right now.  They sure are nice looking engine and the all aluminum aspect I like, just that I like manual trannys.||||reg||1
